mlxflow 0.8; network
1. Template              "https://thehackernews.com/search/label/artificial%20intelligence"
2. Human Input           "Enter a URL to extract:" ; timeout=30s; default=unchanged
3. Web Fetch             as=markdown
4. Template      (2,3)   "From the news index page below, pick the 5 most
                         newsworthy AI items. For each, output exactly one
                         block:\n<article><h3>TITLE</h3> <p>ONE SENTENCE,
                         25 words max</p> <p><a href='URL'>Read the
                         story</a></p> </article>\n\nRules: copy URL
                         verbatim from a [text](url) link in PAGE_TEXT. If
                         it does not begin with http, join it to the
                         origin of PAGE_URL. Never invent a URL. Skip any
                         item you cannot link. Output HTML only, no
                         commentary.\n\nPAGE_URL: {1}\n\nPAGE_TEXT:{2}"
5. Generate              Qwen3 8B
6. Template              "<!doctype html>\n<html><head><meta
                         charset='utf-8'> <title>AI
                         News</title></head>\n<body>\n<h1>AI News</h1>\n
                         {input}\n</body></html>\n"
7. Save Text             links.html
